WEBVTT

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:31.560
What's wrong?

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:36.090
It's not there...

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:37.730
But here.

00:00:38.650 --> 00:00:40.940
Sorry, my hand went astray!

00:01:02.390 --> 00:01:03.590
Yikes!

00:01:04.690 --> 00:01:05.470
Are you okay?

00:01:07.490 --> 00:01:09.040
Thank you.

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:12.030
You have a good level of Chi.

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:14.010
This is the result of training.

00:01:14.830 --> 00:01:15.890
You're very dedicated.

00:01:17.490 --> 00:01:22.110
However, we must continue to improve your Chi.

00:01:24.410 --> 00:01:25.650
I know Kagenoji.

00:01:26.450 --> 00:01:29.290
Do you want to see some interesting topics?

00:01:30.110 --> 00:01:32.230
Hyakka Ryouran

00:01:32.230 --> 00:01:34.010
:Samurai After
Hyakka Ryouran

00:01:37.190 --> 00:01:39.080
Come on, eat!

00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:42.800
W-Wait a minute.

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:44.850
What are you doing, Juubei?

00:01:44.850 --> 00:01:49.230
Juubei is Onii-chan's Samurai Bride now.

00:01:49.230 --> 00:01:51.220
Ah, right then.

00:01:51.220 --> 00:01:53.930
I'm already your wife now, aren't I?

00:01:53.930 --> 00:01:54.750
Huh?

00:01:54.750 --> 00:01:57.770
A wife must attend to her husband.

00:01:57.770 --> 00:01:58.390
Go, take it.

00:01:58.390 --> 00:01:59.730
Ah, wait!
Go, take it.

00:01:59.730 --> 00:02:02.050
What do you think you are doing?

00:02:02.050 --> 00:02:04.630
Just because you're a Samurai Bride now
doesn't mean that you're his wife.

00:02:04.630 --> 00:02:05.400
Huh?

00:02:05.630 --> 00:02:07.070
That's right!

00:02:07.070 --> 00:02:12.570
Being a Samurai Bride is to serve
and take orders from a Master Samurai!

00:02:12.570 --> 00:02:14.570
This is very different than being his wife!

00:02:14.570 --> 00:02:19.530
What? Juubei can't be Onii-chan's wife?

00:02:19.530 --> 00:02:25.630
That is... I didn't say that you couldn't, but... I think it's too early for that.

00:02:25.630 --> 00:02:26.810
I mean...

00:02:26.810 --> 00:02:32.550
If you are confused in choosing a wife, pick a mistress while you wait.

00:02:32.550 --> 00:02:33.930
Gisen!

00:02:33.930 --> 00:02:39.070
Forget that, by saying that you changed the discussion.

00:02:39.070 --> 00:02:42.410
To start with, Juubei, you understand
nothing of what it means to be a wife.

00:02:42.410 --> 00:02:43.790
Come on, eat!
To start with, Juubei, you understand
nothing of what it means to be a wife.

00:02:43.790 --> 00:02:44.110
To start with, Juubei, you understand
nothing of what it means to be a wife.

00:02:44.110 --> 00:02:46.900
At least listen to what I have to say!

00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:51.930
Seriously, to be a wife, it is necessary to know the meaning of it.

00:02:51.930 --> 00:02:53.010
Really?

00:02:53.010 --> 00:02:58.150
Of course! If you can have a certain level of Zen, to be able to pretend...

00:02:58.150 --> 00:02:59.960
I can confirm that!

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:04.450
A Master Samurai must be prepared to give everything for love,

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:08.670
so being his wife is not at all difficult or impossible for me.

00:03:08.670 --> 00:03:10.590
How admirable, Yukimura-sama.

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:14.890
You are the most prepared for love,
as I heard the others discussing.

00:03:14.890 --> 00:03:16.390
And who was that!

00:03:16.390 --> 00:03:20.100
I am not like a certain someone that knows nothing of love.

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:21.790
What are you saying?

00:03:21.790 --> 00:03:22.930
I am also ready to be,

00:03:22.930 --> 00:03:28.350
a good and devoted wife, fully consummated if I wish.

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:31.570
That can be misinterpreted.

00:03:31.570 --> 00:03:32.990
Ignore her.

00:03:32.990 --> 00:03:37.410
Since you will change wife every 3 months, it will not be very complicated.

00:03:38.740 --> 00:03:39.830
Everyone, get down!

00:03:42.490 --> 00:03:43.690
Who was that?

00:03:51.130 --> 00:03:51.760
Who's there?

00:04:00.520 --> 00:04:03.110
She is not normal, beware!

00:04:04.520 --> 00:04:07.730
It's true, they seem interesting.

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:12.030
Impossible! This can't be...

00:04:12.370 --> 00:04:14.790
Uesugi Kagekatsu-sama!

00:04:15.790 --> 00:04:17.310
Tonkatsu-sama?

00:04:17.310 --> 00:04:20.190
You continued to train your Chi it seems.

00:04:20.970 --> 00:04:23.950
You're... Madea Keiji!

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:26.030
Hey, it's been awhile.

00:04:29.590 --> 00:04:30.590
I present,

00:04:30.590 --> 00:04:33.770
I am Uesugi Kagekatsu-sama.

00:04:33.770 --> 00:04:35.380
It's a pleasure.

00:04:35.380 --> 00:04:38.510
Yagyuu Muneakira of dojo Yagyuu.

00:04:38.510 --> 00:04:41.570
After all this time Kagekatsu-sama!

00:04:41.570 --> 00:04:45.010
How do you already know her?

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:50.630
Kagekatsu-sama is a person who has been kind to me,

00:04:50.630 --> 00:04:54.190
and I owe her great respect and recognition.

00:04:54.190 --> 00:04:56.610
We didn't think you could say that.

00:04:56.610 --> 00:05:04.570
She shared meals with me and gave me warmth and softness in tough times.

00:05:05.270 --> 00:05:07.040
It was a long time ago.

00:05:07.790 --> 00:05:10.790
I've also been nice to you.

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:14.010
I will never forget when you
held a picnic and you left me alone,

00:05:14.010 --> 00:05:18.710
or when you have brought me to
the river to fish and I almost drowned,

00:05:18.710 --> 00:05:20.710
both times it was your fault!

00:05:20.710 --> 00:05:22.890
Hmm, I don't remember.

00:05:23.850 --> 00:05:29.030
You have no dignity,
you should learn humility Kagekatsu-sama.

00:05:29.030 --> 00:05:31.230
You mean you're the same, right?

00:05:31.230 --> 00:05:32.450
She should die of shame.

00:05:32.450 --> 00:05:35.350
So what? What brings you to visit us?

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:37.240
Ah, yes.

00:05:38.010 --> 00:05:39.610
I came to see you.

00:05:40.210 --> 00:05:42.550
Wh-What did you say Keiji?

00:05:42.550 --> 00:05:46.370
Hmm.. What's going on? Are you ashamed Muneakira?

00:05:46.370 --> 00:05:47.290
Keiji...

00:05:47.470 --> 00:05:51.590
I see! So you came to be Onii-chan's wife?

00:05:51.590 --> 00:05:52.510
Wife?

00:05:52.510 --> 00:05:58.390
Yes, Juubei managed to be a Samurai Bride,
so now I get to be Onii-chan's wife.

00:05:58.390 --> 00:06:03.870
It's impossible for you
for it is necessary to be charismatic.

00:06:03.870 --> 00:06:06.600
I'm the only one to have that capacity.

00:06:06.600 --> 00:06:10.370
What are you saying? It's not just that,

00:06:10.370 --> 00:06:16.320
I should be his wife since I can
manage everything, even in times of need.

00:06:16.320 --> 00:06:19.690
For a wife the important thing is love.

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:23.250
If this is not enough, we change over every 3 months.

00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:25.530
I don't think she can last as long.

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:27.410
Three minutes, will be her new record.

00:06:27.410 --> 00:06:29.490
Hold On! A moment...

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:32.410
I think you all have something special...

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:34.430
I think I understand.

00:06:35.410 --> 00:06:40.110
I believe there is only one way to settle this.

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:42.390
A match to be his wife.

00:06:42.690 --> 00:06:44.910
A match to be his wife?

00:06:44.910 --> 00:06:48.600
I see you're all persuaded to become perfect wives.

00:06:48.600 --> 00:06:51.450
And it's not even your choice.

00:06:51.450 --> 00:06:52.050
Huh? I... No...

00:06:52.050 --> 00:06:54.350
So it's better to leave this decision to a third party.
Huh? I... No...

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:55.980
So it's better to leave this decision to a third party.

00:06:55.980 --> 00:06:57.110
Huh?!

00:06:57.110 --> 00:06:58.360
How so?

00:06:58.630 --> 00:07:01.770
We will broadcast the game, and points earned.

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:05.910
This will show who, of everyone here, will be the perfect wife according to the highest score.

00:07:05.910 --> 00:07:11.670
I see! It's obvious, I can demonstrate my skill to all.

00:07:11.670 --> 00:07:13.370
Interesting of course!

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:17.510
And also, everyone will give me their support in being his wife.

00:07:17.510 --> 00:07:19.670
As a servant of love, I will not lose.

00:07:19.670 --> 00:07:22.070
I find this very interesting.

00:07:22.070 --> 00:07:23.150
Okay, so it's decided.

00:07:24.150 --> 00:07:26.530
And you two, what will you do?

00:07:27.410 --> 00:07:28.650
Well, the thing is...

00:07:28.650 --> 00:07:31.060
This doesn't seem a bad idea, but...

00:07:31.060 --> 00:07:35.790
we should refrain from participating, to not embarrass our masters.

00:07:35.790 --> 00:07:37.910
Do you both agree?

00:07:38.450 --> 00:07:41.510
I don't know at all what you mean.

00:07:41.510 --> 00:07:45.010
I-I want to give all my support to Yukimura-sama.

00:07:45.780 --> 00:07:48.570
Hanzo, we need to seriously prepare.

00:07:48.570 --> 00:07:50.580
Matabei, there is no time to waste.

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:51.570
Right!
Right!

00:07:56.970 --> 00:07:57.810
Keiji.

00:07:58.850 --> 00:08:03.530
Muneakira is a man, what do you think?

00:08:03.530 --> 00:08:07.070
What do you mean? Muneakira is special.

00:08:07.070 --> 00:08:09.720
Huh? He's special?

00:08:12.350 --> 00:08:16.770
Tell me, will you also participate
Maedake-san, to be Muneakira's wife?

00:08:16.770 --> 00:08:17.690
Who? Me?

00:08:17.690 --> 00:08:20.990
The competition will be better with all of us.

00:08:20.990 --> 00:08:22.990
Hmm, sure why not?

00:08:25.230 --> 00:08:28.170
Well, I will also participate to be Muneakira's wife.

00:08:29.350 --> 00:08:30.370
Keiji!

00:08:30.770 --> 00:08:34.770
Muneakira, I'll show you with my master talents,

00:08:34.770 --> 00:08:39.210
you won't have to worry
about anything when I am your wife.

00:08:39.210 --> 00:08:40.730
Huh? Wai–

00:08:40.730 --> 00:08:44.630
Do not get like that, you're making me blush.

00:08:45.550 --> 00:08:48.390
I will also participate...

00:08:50.350 --> 00:08:52.430
I will not accept...

00:08:52.430 --> 00:08:54.970
Huh, Kagekatsu-sama too?

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:56.530
I am participating.

00:08:56.530 --> 00:08:59.440
Wow, Tonkatsu-san will also participate.

00:08:59.440 --> 00:09:05.870
I respect Kagekatsu-sana, but this will not change the outcome, I will not underestimate.

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:10.290
Okay then, since she is involved, I will withdraw.

00:09:10.290 --> 00:09:11.470
Huh?

00:09:11.470 --> 00:09:14.750
Now that I think about it,
somebody has to take care of the notes.

00:09:14.750 --> 00:09:16.710
I'm going to manage it all.

00:09:17.090 --> 00:09:18.190
I will not!

00:09:18.190 --> 00:09:21.910
I look forward to seeing your skills as a wife.

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:23.790
Keiji, you...

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:26.090
You can not give up.

00:09:29.610 --> 00:09:38.330
The show will be broadcast from our school thanks to the camera in Muneakira's contact lenses...

00:09:38.330 --> 00:09:44.860
And there are other cameras throughout the dojo so we can observe from different angles,

00:09:44.860 --> 00:09:46.610
everyone's diligent efforts.

00:09:47.350 --> 00:09:54.190
And after seeing these images, the public will vote for the person who appears to be the ideal wife.

00:09:54.190 --> 00:09:58.620
The winner will be the one who
has obtained the most votes.

00:09:58.620 --> 00:10:00.960
This will commence over one week.

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:04.150
I can't wait to see how they fair.

00:10:04.150 --> 00:10:05.550
This will be interesting.

00:10:06.970 --> 00:10:08.460
Day One

00:10:17.730 --> 00:10:22.410
The disciplinary committee will always be at your service,

00:10:22.410 --> 00:10:27.650
we will all be at your side,
even after your marriage, to fulfill our duties.

00:10:27.650 --> 00:10:32.790
Well, then we start with the training for that to happen.

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:33.530
Right!

00:10:38.150 --> 00:10:41.490
Hanzo! This place is still dirty.

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:43.410
Yes, right away.

00:10:45.090 --> 00:10:47.430
Show more effort!

00:10:48.230 --> 00:10:52.050
Mistress, thank you for teaching me.

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:57.910
As the big sister of the concubines,
the wife must be charismatic.

00:10:57.910 --> 00:11:01.190
So? What do you think of my skills?

00:11:05.820 --> 00:11:09.240
A wife is the finance minister of the home.

00:11:09.240 --> 00:11:12.740
She is the woman who supports
her husband by managing expenses.

00:11:12.740 --> 00:11:16.370
Yukimura-sama, the energy bill has increased this month.

00:11:16.370 --> 00:11:17.580
What should we do?

00:11:18.790 --> 00:11:21.710
Well, we start the summer season

00:11:21.710 --> 00:11:24.210
wearing lightweight clothing, to save costs.

00:11:24.210 --> 00:11:26.130
Get our swimsuits.

00:11:26.130 --> 00:11:26.920
Right!

00:11:30.670 --> 00:11:33.790
This way, we can save 30% more.

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:35.730
That's fantastic Yukimura-sama.

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:41.830
Onii-chan!

00:11:41.830 --> 00:11:43.810
Huh? What?

00:11:43.810 --> 00:11:47.070
It's a beautiful sunny day, let's go for a walk.

00:11:47.670 --> 00:11:50.210
Don't cling to me so much, Juubei!

00:11:50.210 --> 00:11:52.820
Fine, let's go for a walk.

00:11:52.820 --> 00:11:54.390
Great!

00:11:58.370 --> 00:12:01.710
Why does Juubei have more points?

00:12:01.710 --> 00:12:04.710
Juubei has proved nothing at all!

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:08.090
Really interesting!

00:12:08.590 --> 00:12:10.350
I feel a bit hungry.

00:12:11.350 --> 00:12:12.090
Huh!?

00:12:12.090 --> 00:12:14.970
K-Kanetsugu! Why are you dressed like that?

00:12:14.970 --> 00:12:19.470
We're preparing to bake a cream pie!

00:12:19.470 --> 00:12:22.290
Does this outfit look really good?

00:12:22.290 --> 00:12:24.710
It suits you perfectly Kagekatsu-sama.

00:12:24.710 --> 00:12:26.130
Oh-Oh I see.

00:12:27.250 --> 00:12:32.290
I found a way to win,
without embarrassing Kagekatsu-sama.

00:12:37.160 --> 00:12:39.710
Do you want to feel closer to your fiance?

00:12:39.710 --> 00:12:43.290
Here is the recipe for a more attractive body...

00:12:43.290 --> 00:12:45.290
Huh? This is exactly what I need!

00:12:46.270 --> 00:12:49.850
In the kitchen, I can show my skills,

00:12:49.850 --> 00:12:53.170
and also help out Kagekatsu-sama.

00:12:53.170 --> 00:12:56.070
Kanetsugu, what should I do?

00:12:56.070 --> 00:13:02.210
Well, let's see... can you start
preparing the whipped cream?

00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:03.210
Okay sure.

00:13:05.690 --> 00:13:08.130
Stop! Not like that!

00:13:08.890 --> 00:13:11.270
Are you okay Kagekatsu-san?

00:13:11.270 --> 00:13:13.770
Muneakira, sorry.

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:15.530
Oh, it's okay...

00:13:18.410 --> 00:13:20.780
I made a mess of your clothes.

00:13:20.780 --> 00:13:22.250
I'm really sorry.

00:13:22.250 --> 00:13:24.590
Nothing serious, don't worry.

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:28.410
Kagekatsu-sama! I will help you–

00:13:31.310 --> 00:13:32.570
Are you okay, Kanetsugu?

00:13:39.070 --> 00:13:40.760
Well played, Kagenoji.

00:13:41.790 --> 00:13:43.680
I would have never thought she would do that!

00:13:43.680 --> 00:13:47.170
Nobody really understands what it means to be a wife.

00:13:47.170 --> 00:13:49.470
I will continue to fight.

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:51.130
Without holding back.

00:13:52.520 --> 00:13:54.180
Day Two

00:13:54.210 --> 00:13:56.570
Oh! Not now Muneakira!

00:13:56.570 --> 00:14:00.630
This place is still very dirty, I have not finished cleaning.

00:14:00.630 --> 00:14:03.510
Mistress, I brought you–

00:14:08.370 --> 00:14:11.150
Please excuse my clumsiness, Mistress.

00:14:11.150 --> 00:14:15.070
Oh no, I'm all wet now.

00:14:19.760 --> 00:14:22.090
We must save more energy.

00:14:22.090 --> 00:14:22.760
Right!

00:14:27.890 --> 00:14:31.210
This will allow to save 70% more on energy.

00:14:31.210 --> 00:14:33.030
Do you like our new outfits.

00:14:33.030 --> 00:14:34.390
Not on your life!

00:14:38.230 --> 00:14:42.730
Onii-chan, you have a rice grain on you.
Juubei will remove it for you.

00:14:47.190 --> 00:14:49.270
Are you okay Juu–

00:14:50.850 --> 00:14:52.830
S-Sorry!

00:14:57.930 --> 00:15:02.830
Seriously, it seems they all
chose a strategy of debauchery.

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:05.670
Juubei did not know.

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:08.070
Don't act like you didn't know!

00:15:08.070 --> 00:15:11.870
Believe me, I'll show you who is best.

00:15:23.070 --> 00:15:26.470
Whoa! Another way to use Chi.

00:15:26.470 --> 00:15:27.900
That's incredible Kanetsugu!

00:15:32.390 --> 00:15:35.710
Here is the Master Samurai of Love and Justice.

00:15:35.710 --> 00:15:39.380
Magical girl Gutsugutsu-san!

00:15:52.590 --> 00:15:54.670
You're naked.

00:15:56.850 --> 00:16:00.190
How shameless!

00:16:06.830 --> 00:16:10.150
I wonder, what I should do?

00:16:11.170 --> 00:16:12.230
Kagenoji!

00:16:14.110 --> 00:16:15.110
Keiji.

00:16:16.210 --> 00:16:17.330
What's is it?

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:18.770
You look sad.

00:16:22.970 --> 00:16:24.350
Hey! Kagenoji!

00:16:25.010 --> 00:16:27.180
You know, I'm very happy now.

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:29.630
Why?

00:16:29.990 --> 00:16:31.450
It's obvious right?

00:16:31.450 --> 00:16:37.810
Thanks to this competition, everyone will see you are the best, Kagenoji.

00:16:39.110 --> 00:16:42.090
I want you to participate more, much more.

00:16:42.090 --> 00:16:47.010
But even if I win,
I will not be Keiji's wife.

00:16:48.410 --> 00:16:52.450
Being his wife is not the problem here.

00:16:52.990 --> 00:16:56.050
Don't worry, I will see to it that nothing will go wrong.

00:16:59.090 --> 00:17:06.710
My dream is to have many children
with Kagenoji and to create a football team.

00:17:07.590 --> 00:17:11.530
Keiji, I can't have many children.

00:17:12.950 --> 00:17:16.230
No problem, then just half will do!

00:17:16.590 --> 00:17:17.510
Right?

00:17:18.350 --> 00:17:21.850
Okay, I'll do my best.

00:17:23.730 --> 00:17:25.500
Day Three

00:17:38.790 --> 00:17:40.510
Day Four

00:17:49.050 --> 00:17:50.770
Day Five

00:18:03.820 --> 00:18:05.520
Day Six

00:18:19.570 --> 00:18:20.890
What a grand show.

00:18:21.810 --> 00:18:23.440
They sure like to stay close!

00:18:23.440 --> 00:18:25.260
It is not over yet!

00:18:25.260 --> 00:18:27.990
Love will be the winner!

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:30.350
This is the last battle!

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:33.510
Last Day

00:18:35.950 --> 00:18:38.530
Muneakira, I'll wash your back.

00:18:38.530 --> 00:18:40.990
No, I will.

00:18:40.990 --> 00:18:43.770
No, it's me who will wash Muneakira's back.

00:18:43.770 --> 00:18:46.210
Juubei wants to!

00:18:46.210 --> 00:18:48.880
Hey get away, you are in my way.

00:18:49.790 --> 00:18:51.530
I want to wash your back.

00:18:55.450 --> 00:18:58.270
I-I can't breathe.

00:18:58.270 --> 00:19:00.060
I'm sorry, Muneakira.

00:19:00.060 --> 00:19:02.460
If that's how it's going to be...

00:19:02.460 --> 00:19:06.370
It is quite normal to provide you this service.

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:08.250
What do you think Muneakira?

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:11.170
I can not lose. What do you think?

00:19:11.170 --> 00:19:13.590
You can't do anything being so flat.

00:19:13.590 --> 00:19:15.620
You don't have much either!

00:19:15.620 --> 00:19:19.480
Sounds like fun! Breasts attack!

00:19:20.310 --> 00:19:21.570
Mistress!

00:19:21.570 --> 00:19:22.670
Yukimura-sama!

00:19:22.670 --> 00:19:24.980
Arrest them both!

00:19:25.310 --> 00:19:26.570
We don't need to interfere.

00:19:26.570 --> 00:19:31.670
Whatever happens, they must win
this battle with only their own efforts.

00:19:32.410 --> 00:19:36.970
And also, lovers who support their master's wife

00:19:36.970 --> 00:19:40.710
could do much more if the wife were not around.

00:19:41.510 --> 00:19:45.490
I don't want to be a hindrance for my Mistress.

00:19:45.490 --> 00:19:49.260
If I mix now, it would be boring to Yukimura-sama.

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:55.110
Muneakira, I'll wash you completely.

00:19:55.640 --> 00:19:57.050
Leave him to me.

00:19:57.050 --> 00:19:59.220
I will not lose.

00:20:02.910 --> 00:20:05.150
You're tickling me, Onii-chan!

00:20:05.830 --> 00:20:07.410
Sorry Juubei!

00:20:07.410 --> 00:20:08.430
It wasn't on purprose.

00:20:08.430 --> 00:20:09.490
Wait a minute!

00:20:10.630 --> 00:20:14.470
The Mistress must accept any desire of the husband,

00:20:14.470 --> 00:20:18.120
regardless of the location or the manner.

00:20:18.120 --> 00:20:21.710
The lover has to bring everything

00:20:21.710 --> 00:20:23.370
to offer...

00:20:23.370 --> 00:20:24.550
A husband...

00:20:25.110 --> 00:20:26.210
I understand.

00:20:27.380 --> 00:20:30.420
I didn't finish, come here!

00:20:30.420 --> 00:20:32.420
Come here, Muneakira!

00:20:32.420 --> 00:20:34.300
I will not let you.

00:20:34.300 --> 00:20:35.640
I will not lose!

00:20:37.330 --> 00:20:39.310
Are you okay, Onii-chan?

00:20:42.610 --> 00:20:43.830
Muneakira!

00:20:43.830 --> 00:20:45.710
You realize what you're doing?

00:20:45.710 --> 00:20:47.150
What did you say?

00:20:47.150 --> 00:20:49.030
It's also your fault!

00:20:49.030 --> 00:20:50.480
I support you more.

00:20:50.480 --> 00:20:51.870
What did you do?

00:20:51.870 --> 00:20:53.630
Let's end it now!

00:20:53.630 --> 00:20:54.990
I agree!

00:20:54.990 --> 00:20:56.650
This is war!

00:21:02.590 --> 00:21:04.270
Muneakira, is mine!

00:21:04.890 --> 00:21:07.430
Could it be!

00:21:07.880 --> 00:21:10.490
Your words are worthless!

00:21:11.230 --> 00:21:13.770
I will show you the power of Kagekatsu.

00:21:15.720 --> 00:21:17.110
Me too.

00:21:22.650 --> 00:21:24.930
Everyone please stop it!

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:26.850
Muneakira...

00:21:27.550 --> 00:21:33.940
I... I do not think this is the right way to make the decision.

00:21:34.410 --> 00:21:35.670
Onii-chan...

00:21:36.010 --> 00:21:37.850
Remember!

00:21:37.850 --> 00:21:40.570
When Juubei had to turn into a Samurai Bride.

00:21:40.570 --> 00:21:44.370
The same year, our hearts were all one!

00:21:47.490 --> 00:21:50.630
So why make that disappear now?

00:21:54.090 --> 00:21:57.880
Even for me, I cannot suddently decide on a wife.

00:21:57.880 --> 00:22:02.650
It's something that requires reflection and time!

00:22:10.450 --> 00:22:12.150
Hey, that was well spoken.

00:22:12.150 --> 00:22:13.350
Keiji!

00:22:13.350 --> 00:22:15.690
It's true Muneakira!

00:22:16.010 --> 00:22:19.770
It is not good choosing
a wife through a competition.

00:22:19.770 --> 00:22:23.050
Huh? But it was you who...

00:22:24.270 --> 00:22:26.330
I saw a wonderful show.

00:22:26.330 --> 00:22:27.670
Show?

00:22:27.670 --> 00:22:29.370
What is this about, Keiji?

00:22:29.370 --> 00:22:30.580
Well...

00:22:30.890 --> 00:22:33.870
It was fun seeing Kagenoji's confused face.

00:22:33.870 --> 00:22:36.340
How lucky. It was perfect.

00:22:37.090 --> 00:22:39.710
Hey! Just what what were you thinking?

00:22:39.710 --> 00:22:42.260
Someone should give you a decent beating.

00:22:42.260 --> 00:22:43.990
Oh, how scarry!

00:22:43.990 --> 00:22:46.250
It will dark soon, I'm going home.

00:22:46.250 --> 00:22:49.110
Kagenoji, I will wait for you.

00:22:49.110 --> 00:22:50.900
Oh...Yes.

00:22:50.900 --> 00:22:52.520
See you next time.

00:22:55.070 --> 00:22:57.810
Wh-What does all this mean?

00:23:01.860 --> 00:23:06.930
I think it was a good idea to stay behind.

00:24:12.440 --> 00:24:15.940
What did you think of Yagyuu Muneakira?

00:24:16.210 --> 00:24:18.770
Certainly, he is a very interesting man.

00:24:19.370 --> 00:24:22.210
But Keiji, what's going on in your head?

00:24:22.210 --> 00:24:23.630
Sorry.

00:24:23.930 --> 00:24:28.410
When we return to Yonezawa,
I'll ask your forgiveness.

00:24:31.410 --> 00:24:33.890
Keiji, you idiot.
